message: "If you use this software in your research, please cite it as below."
title: "FEN — Triadic Synthesis Framework: A Federated Epistemic Node for Community-Governed Knowledge Validation"
abstract: >-
  A research prototype and reference architecture for a federated epistemic
  validation layer for community-governed linguistic knowledge: AI scaffolds,
  the community decides, the knowledge graph records. Runnable companion
  implementation of "Decentralised Agentic Governance: A Methodology for
  Community-Owned Linguistic Datasets and Knowledge Synthesis" (Riznyk, 2026,
  DOI pending).
